# ============================================================
# SmartAI Pro — .gitignore (v21.36.0 GitHub-connect)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# PRINCIPLE: anything that is a SECRET, live TRADING STATE, a
# build artifact, or a dependency is EXCLUDED. Only source + docs
# + templates + config-schemas ship to GitHub. When in doubt,
# IGNORE — a missed source file is easy to re-add; a committed
# CoinDCX key or live journal is not recoverable.
# ============================================================

# --- Node dependencies & build output (regenerated, not source) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
.vite/
.turbo/

# --- Secrets & credentials — NEVER commit ---
# the real .env holds APP_PIN / API_TOKEN / CoinDCX keys / LLM provider keys
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.p12
id_rsa*
*.key
# runtime token + session files (service/session auth material)
.api-token
.session-token
.st3.json

# --- Live trading state & runtime data — NEVER commit ---
server/data/
data/
server-data/
config/
models/
ml-service/models/
telegram-bot/.state.json
# backup / pre-live snapshots (kept alongside server/data)
*.bak
*.pre-live-*.bak
*.tradeAll-off-*

# --- Logs & Windows stray artifacts ---
*.log
nul

# --- Agent / editor / OS cruft ---
.claude/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Keep the EMPTY templates tracked (they document required vars) ---
!.env.example
!telegram-bot/.env.example
